🇷🇺⚔️🇺🇦 Key points from Russia's Defense Ministry weekly briefing:

➡️Russian forces conducted one massed strike and nine group strikes over the week, hitting Ukrainian military-industrial enterprises and logistics hubs;

➡️Russian forces struck production workshops for ground robotic systems, uncrewed surface vessels, and preparation/launch sites for "Flamingo" missiles;

➡️Russian forces hit infrastructure at Ukrainian ports used for unloading and storing military cargo;

➡️Over the week, 2 Ukrainian navy patrol boats and 12 vessels operating in support of the Ukrainian military were hit;

➡️The Black Sea Fleet destroyed two Ukrainian uncrewed surface vessels over the week;

➡️Ukrainian forces lost 17 Western-made armored vehicles over the week in the Southern Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Russian forces destroyed a Czech-made Vampire MLRS vehicle in the Center Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Ukrainian forces lost over 1,490 personnel over the week in the West Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Over 2,340 personnel lost in the East Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Over 260 personnel lost in the Dnepr Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Over 1,660 personnel lost in the Southern Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Over 2,550 personnel lost in the Center Group's area of responsibility;

➡️Up to 1,550 personnel lost in the North Group's area of responsibility.

